---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="chi-siamo" class="fade-in-up delay-300 py-24 bg-white font-['Inter'] relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Chi Siamo
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-950 tracking-tight mb-4 leading-tight">
        Costruiamo Valore Sostenibile Attraverso la <span class="text-lime-500 font-black">Progettazione</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Uniamo competenze tecniche e prontezza operativa per eliminare i passaggi superflui. Gestiamo ogni fase del tuo progetto immobiliare garantendo efficienza, conformità e risultati d'eccellenza.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 items-center items-stretch lg:px-12">
      
      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md aspect-[4/5] md:aspect-auto flex">
        <img 
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154526-990dced4db0d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" 
          alt="Studio di progettazione e riunione tecnica" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="bg-lime-400 text-slate-950 rounded-2xl p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-lg relative min-h-[380px] md:min-h-[420px] md:-translate-y-4 z-10 transition-transform duration-300">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-8 h-8 bg-slate-950 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-white font-black text-sm">E</span>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold tracking-tight">Edilpartner</span>
        </div>

        <div class="my-auto">
          <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold leading-snug tracking-tight text-slate-950">
            “Ci concentriamo sulla creazione di soluzioni integrate stabili, riducendo a zero la burocrazia e i tempi morti del cantiere.”
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-800">— Direzione Tecnica</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md aspect-[4/5] md:aspect-auto flex">
        <img 
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541888946425-d81bb19240f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" 
          alt="Operazioni e logistica in cantiere" 
          class="w-full h-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="text-center mt-12 md:mt-16">
      <a 
        href="#servizi" 
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold bg-lime-400 text-slate-950 hover:bg-lime-300 shadow-md transition-all text-xs sm:text-sm tracking-wide"
      >
        Scopri di più
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>